# SomePkg
library "SomePkg".

// Multi-layer (terminology + coded-from). WOULD auto-split if it were a local
// sibling, but it is a PACKAGE (emitted under its own name, never split in this
// consumer), so a ref into it must NOT trip the split-library guard.
terminology "Pkg T":
- valueset is `urn:pkg-vs`.

concept "Pkg C":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- coded from "Pkg T".
